WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.556 --> 00:00:14.221
The tied up the Tang Monk in a dark room.

2
00:00:17.903 --> 00:00:20.804
Then the demon dragged in Bajie and Wujing.

3
00:00:21.564 --> 00:00:23.185
They were still trapped in the vests.

4
00:00:27.387 --> 00:00:29.928
The demon dumped them in a corner and approached the monk.

5
00:00:31.892 --> 00:00:37.196
"I've been hoping you would pass my mountain," the demon said with an evil smile.

6
00:00:37.216 --> 00:00:40.398
"Please let us go," said the Tang Monk.

7
00:00:41.159 --> 00:00:42.980
"We're trying to reach the Western Paradise."

8
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:47.123
"I know where you're going," said the demon.

9
00:00:47.143 --> 00:00:51.606
"I also know that I'll live forever if I eat you."

10
00:00:51.626 --> 00:00:54.468
"Who are you?"

11
00:00:54.849 --> 00:00:56.670
demanded Wujing from the corner.

12
00:00:57.871 --> 00:00:59.232
demon turned to face him.

13
00:01:00.873 --> 00:01:03.075
"I am One-Horned Buffalo."

14
00:01:04.757 --> 00:01:07.099
friend will find us soon," said Bajie.

15
00:01:07.119 --> 00:01:09.041
"He's very powerful.

16
00:01:09.741 --> 00:01:13.445
And when he learns that you kidnapped us, he'll destroy your entire mountain."

17
00:01:15.387 --> 00:01:16.488
Buffalo smirked.

18
00:01:16.508 --> 00:01:18.250
"Who is your friend?"

19
00:01:19.471 --> 00:01:22.233
"His name is Sun Wukong," said Bajie.

20
00:01:23.014 --> 00:01:24.796
The demon's smirk disappeared.

21
00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:28.722
"Is he the Sun Wukong who caused trouble in Heaven?"

22
00:01:28.742 --> 00:01:30.522
The demon sounded nervous.

23
00:01:32.223 --> 00:01:34.164
he is," said Wujing.

24
00:01:34.184 --> 00:01:37.205
"Heaven's entire army couldn't defeat him."

25
00:01:38.446 --> 00:01:41.687
"Even the Jade Emperor is afraid of him," Bajie added.

26
00:01:43.628 --> 00:01:44.969
Buffalo stood taller.

27
00:01:44.989 --> 00:01:47.970
"Well, I'm not afraid of him!"

28
00:01:49.831 --> 00:01:51.272
The demon walked out of the room.

29
00:01:54.264 --> 00:01:57.206
Once he was away from the others though, he grew worried again.

30
00:01:57.226 --> 00:02:01.109
"That monkey is powerful," he said to himself.

31
00:02:01.129 --> 00:02:05.072
"I'm going to need my special weapon to defeat him."

32
00:02:06.012 --> 00:02:10.295
He lifted his sleeve, revealing a metal ring around his arm.

33
00:02:12.657 --> 00:02:16.279
Carrying food, Wukong returned to where he'd left his friends.

34
00:02:18.481 --> 00:02:21.002
When he didn't see them, he looked up toward the monastery.

35
00:02:22.103 --> 00:02:23.104
building was gone.

36
00:02:24.264 --> 00:02:26.285
In its place was a dark cave.

37
00:02:28.545 --> 00:02:29.145
shook his head.

38
00:02:29.166 --> 00:02:32.046
"That monastery was an illusion.

39
00:02:33.307 --> 00:02:35.087
demon must have made it to trick people."

40
00:02:37.468 --> 00:02:38.568
He stamped his foot.

41
00:02:39.549 --> 00:02:42.609
"Why don't my friends believe me when I warn them about demons?"

42
00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:46.070
He put down the food and rushed to the cave.

43
00:02:49.832 --> 00:02:50.972
up!" shouted the monkey.

44
00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:55.763
"If you don't, I'll turn this entire mountain into a pile of rubble!"

45
00:02:57.284 --> 00:03:00.987
The door flew open, and One-Horned Buffalo stepped out.

46
00:03:01.007 --> 00:03:03.148
"Why are you yelling?"

47
00:03:03.489 --> 00:03:04.489
demanded the demon.

48
00:03:04.509 --> 00:03:06.030
"It's rude!"

49
00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:08.812
"Release my friends!"

50
00:03:09.273 --> 00:03:10.073
yelled Wukong.

51
00:03:10.093 --> 00:03:14.356
"No." One-Horned Buffalo folded his arms.

52
00:03:14.376 --> 00:03:17.358
"I'm not going to release your friends.

53
00:03:18.279 --> 00:03:19.200
They're criminals.

54
00:03:19.904 --> 00:03:22.285
They stole my valuable silk vests."

55
00:03:24.206 --> 00:03:25.967
a lie," said Wukong.

56
00:03:26.748 --> 00:03:28.649
"The Tang Monk is a good and honest man.

57
00:03:29.929 --> 00:03:30.970
would never steal.

58
00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:36.793
I can't believe you would even suggest— "It was the pig," said the demon.

59
00:03:36.813 --> 00:03:40.935
"Oh." The monkey scratched his head.

60
00:03:42.576 --> 00:03:43.316
then I believe you.

61
00:03:43.537 --> 00:03:44.877
But that doesn't matter!"

62
00:03:46.418 --> 00:03:49.500
Wukong pulled out his iron bar and swung it at the demon.

63
00:03:51.148 --> 00:03:55.810
One-Horned Buffalo dodged the bar, which smashed into the mountainside.

64
00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:59.391
Rocks exploded and tumbled down the mountain's slope.

65
00:04:00.811 --> 00:04:02.392
The demon glared at Wukong.

66
00:04:03.472 --> 00:04:04.172
remember you.

67
00:04:04.792 --> 00:04:07.593
The Jade Emperor might fear you, but I don't!"

68
00:04:08.774 --> 00:04:12.135
He rushed at Wukong, and the monkey swung his iron bar again.

69
00:04:13.715 --> 00:04:15.496
The demon blocked it with his arm.

70
00:04:17.876 --> 00:04:21.259
"Ow!" cried One-Horned Buffalo, rubbing his arm.

71
00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:25.162
He fell to his knees and turned his back to the monkey.

72
00:04:25.182 --> 00:04:29.966
"My iron bar is not an ordinary weapon," said Wukong.

73
00:04:31.027 --> 00:04:32.388
extremely heavy."

74
00:04:33.589 --> 00:04:36.131
He noticed the demon reaching up his sleeve.

75
00:04:37.152 --> 00:04:37.832
"What are you doing?"

76
00:04:39.073 --> 00:04:42.296
One-Horned Buffalo spun around, holding up the metal ring.

77
00:04:44.017 --> 00:04:47.340
Instantly Wukong felt himself being pulled toward the ring.

78
00:04:48.352 --> 00:04:51.556
Using all of his strength, the monkey leaped into the air.

79
00:04:53.237 --> 00:04:55.119
But the bar was ripped from his hands.

80
00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:59.244
It flew into the metal ring and vanished.
